// AWS IAM New Managed Policy Version Created  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1098.003
// Detects creation of a new version of a customer-managed policy (CreatePolicyVersion). Combined with SetDefaultPolicyVersion this can…
// False positives: Legitimate policy updates.
// Source: rules/privilege-escalation/iam-create-policy-version.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^CreatePolicyVersion$/i eventSource=/^iam\.amazonaws\.com$/i
